{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">2002 AMC 12A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems\">2002 AMC 10A #10</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute the sum of all the roots of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b075ab9912926a36af152a82073cad1547be9259.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+3)(x-4)+(2x+3)(x-6)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"296\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a753882347e0b6bbe5421886240d0cff727dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{7}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 4\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 5\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"368\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We expand to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d6a46c2a828082c133420e7dac47d02a04cddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2-8x+3x-12+2x^2-12x+3x-18=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"368\" height=\"18\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae3394a376e97fd66a3495c9c319e77d3ce9efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-14x-30=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" /> after combining like terms. Using the quadratic part of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, we find the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/d/68d20ac8bc0fa046d3d725f5ed93cb04baec591a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}4 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }7/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/b/eeb1fbde2006282bd9acdb250461037c88abf5c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" /> term in both addends so we can factor the equation to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1df6a00276e0069f4c4e362a255b0923e79ceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+3)((x-4)+(x-6))=(2x+3)(2x-10)=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"416\" height=\"20\" /> The two roots become obvious: they are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbc60fdf37f15079cc1212df9413c08b0bd7671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1d54ff7407325afd1e5c0896274da8cfc7e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" /> Adding these two gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e38a026ca57cedd1487ee15d6bb75818cbfc2ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }7/2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>-starwarmonkey\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kNEqKCJsOR4\">https://youtu.be/kNEqKCJsOR4</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Probl